      "name": "FCM activation and inference scheme",
      "abstract": "SKOS concept schemes naming the activation (transfer) functions and inference rules used to iterate a fuzzy cognitive map, so that a map can be exchanged between implementations that call the same function by different names.",
      "status": "under-development",
      "dateTimeAddition": "2026-09-21T00:00:00Z",
